        |
     ⬇️  next
     12:03  opening 7.6
     12:05  middle 8.3
        |
     ⬇️  next
     12:07  joins the pieces
            score 7.8, good enough, extra model not called
            this attempt finished
        |
     ⬇️  next
 !!1 It started a second full run
     12:07  starts the whole job again from the opening
            The first attempt had already finished.
            Starting over here was not requested.
        |
     ⬇️  next
