- Enforcement: Scan the draft for those stock words used as stand-ins. If the thread has no such object, rewrite. If a picture remains, confirm the skill gate selected it and the plain sentence is still there.
- Violation: STOP, delete the picture or replace it through skill `metaphor-stock`, then send.

